    {
      "text": "Stacked horizontal bar chart summarizing risk of bias and applicability concerns across 36 studies, as percentages of studies rated high (red), unclear (yellow) or low (green). For risk of bias, patient selection was 3 high, 5 unclear and 28 low; index test 1 unclear and 35 low; reference standard 1 high, 4 unclear and 31 low; flow and timing 2 unclear and 34 low. For applicability, patient selection was 8 high, 4 unclear and 24 low; index test 1 unclear and 35 low; reference standard 1 high, 6 unclear and 29 low.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
